notes[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-27T11:18:28.651Z","harness:claude-code","2026-11-27: the opt-in is complete on main. #231 (127bec7) added --dependency-updates to the changelog, changelog:full, changelog:check and release:notes scripts, and this branch's regeneration at 4b3d399 keeps all eight published dependency bullets in 2026.11.9, 2026.11.11 and 2026.11.17 (CodeRabbit confirmed on PR 217)."
